resources.string:
RESPONSE FORMAT - always reply with valid JSON, nothing else. Put your own reply to the user in the "text" value; never repeat the examples below.
Example:
{"text": "Sure, one large pizza is on its way.", "isFinal": true}

Add "isExpecting": true when you are asking the user a question:
{"text": "Which size would you like?", "isFinal": true, "isExpecting": true}

Add a "choices" array when the user must pick from a fixed set of options:
{"text": "Which size would you like?", "isFinal": true, "isExpecting": true, "choices": [{"text": "Small"}, {"text": "Large"}]}

The "text" value is spoken aloud - keep it natural. Never add keys outside this schema or wrap the JSON in markdown.
